metro police saying late rent is what  led a man to shoot and kill two women  here in las vegas 79-year-old arnaldo  sanchez is now behind bars in connection  with the double murder another victim  remains in the hospital at this hour  thanks for joining us here at four i'm  kirsten joyce and i'm christian casa as  we begin with that developing story on  this tuesday afternoon this unfolded  just after midnight at a home on chicago  avenue off of industrial now this area  is referred to as naked city near the  strat that's where we find joe muller  live and joe the landlord didn't go  through the eviction process correct  christian that's right according to the  arrest report we received from metro  this all happened over late rent rent  that was not paid according to that  that's what the victims apparently in  the situation were missing their rent  and this is what happened two victims  were found shot outside of this home  here two women were found with gunshot  wounds and they both were deceased and  the third victim was transported to the  hospital now it was just after midnight  when shots were fired arnaldo lozano  sanchez does own the home and was also  living in it renting out half of it to  the victims a witness told police  several days ago sanchez became angry  about the occupants not paying rent and  told him he would handle this his own  way one of the other tenants who made it  out alive says sanchez was smiling and  laughing after pulling the trigger the  two women who died are identified in the  arrest report as dawn and paula the man  shot is a sephirano reyes he was shot  nine times i spoke to myron who lives  nearby he says he knows sanchez and is  surprised this happened  the guy was nice i you know i talked to  him i gave him cans you know all that he  came around my building all the time and  never would have thought he would do  something that  insane i feel bad for him because he  shouldn't have to resort to that but i  also feel bad for them because  this shouldn't have happened at all  according to the arrest report after the  shooting sanchez told neighbors nearby  to hold on to that firearm that was used  they told police where it was hidden in  a nearby bush sanchez now faces two  counts of open murder and one count of  attempted murder back out here live  serena reyes is in stable condition  tonight sanchez is set to be in court  tomorrow reporting live near saher in  las vegas boulevard joe mulvaney great  news now
 

